Authorize .cronrc in the specified
directory

Usage:
  cron-person dir allow [path] [flags]

Arguments:
  [path]
    Directory containing .cronrc
    (defaults to current directory or
    nearest ancestor)

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for allow

Global Flags:
      --config string
        Path to custom configuration
        file (default:
        $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cron-person/config.json)
      --store string
        Path to custom authorization
        state file (default:
        $XDG_STATE_HOME/cron-person/allowed.json)
